      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-03-20_WidnesExaminer_art0022" n="art0022">
        <p>Eleven good reasons why ladies should, when selecting a New Dress, give the preference to a Pine finished one.</p>
        <p>Pine finish is a Durable finish. Impervious to all conditions of clirriate. Remains smart after constant, wear. Lends itself to artistic draping. Earns the approval of the wearer.</p>
        <p>Fashionable because modern in style. In season in Spring, Summer, Autumn and -Winter. Never spots, cockles or shrinks. Increases in popular favour daily. Stylish in appearance and texture. Has n,o rival for elegance and economy in dress.</p>
        <p>See Drapery Window for special Pine Show. MARCH 20th to 27th.</p>
      </div>
