        <p>THE WHITECHAPEL MURDER. THE HOUSE WHERE THE ARRESTS WERE MADE.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-03-20_WidnesExaminer_art0082" n="art0082">
        <gap reason="ocrQuality" quantity="1" unit="words">
