        <p>Winwick. JUNDAy a ..)CH ooL PRIZE DISTRIBUTION.—The annual Vve-giying in connection with Sundayschool scholars, :f_rubers of the Choir and Bible Class was held in the ";"001roorn on Monday evening, the Rev. CabOn Penrhyn ante:blip&amp; There was a very good attendance of parents th_ guardians. The concert, given some weeks ago by :Iv school children and wranged by lis B. Penrhyn, • 8 ror . a-ated MasterA Wavwell who, bad not missed a yA2!l_lO attendance at choir and choir practice for four ''re, Was presented by the Canon with a Special prize.</p>
