        <p>BRITISH COLUMBIA,</p>
        <p>CANADA.</p>
        <p>If you want a glorious existence, a perfect climate and splendid returns upon a moderate capital, write for our Illustrated and descriptive Booklet " F." It's Yiee.</p>
        <p>McDERMID AND McHARDY, 210, PORTAGE AVENUE, WINNIPEG, CANADA.</p>
        <p>LOOK OUT FOR SWAY SPECIALITIES ' THE 6 p C 9 TWENTIETH CENTUR CARPET CLEANER</p>
        <p>your Carpois and Freshen their Colour. Order through your Stores or direct, . • 1). ji Free hi. Is. 2d. from THE Skt AV MANUFACTURING CO., 43 Spooner Street, Biriuirglrim.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-03-20_WidnesExaminer_art0120" n="art0120">
        <head>Gai</head>
        <p>Gai</p>
        <p>To a few women</p>
        <p>Many English women stick to the ways their mothers taught them. But there are.a few women who are always on the look-out for better ways of doing things. To those women we have something to say.</p>
        <p>The Fels-Naptha Way is a bett</p>
        <p>way of doing your washing.</p>
        <p>All you need to do is to try it next washing day. If you are not satisfied, your grocer returns your money. You .keep the soap. So there !</p>
        <p>White clothes</p>
        <p>Wet the clothes, and soap the soiled Rafts with Fels-Naptha soap. Roll dal piece into a close roll, and place them all in a tub with ,enough water to cover them. Soak for thirty minutes</p>
        <p>Fels.- Naptha</p>
        <p>The soap with a Way of its own.</p>
        <p>Then rub in the same water; rub a little in the</p>
        <p>rinsing water; rinse in the usual way. That's all.</p>
      </div>
