        <p>. . MR. THOMAS PEMBER- , who was born on September 3rd, 1861, at ,- Town's End, is the son - 30 of Mr. Thos. Pemberton, an -ironworker, who 4 emigrated to Queensland in 1882, and died there, ' about three years ago. t. • , , All the family, with the , 4AO : exception of Mr, T. ,;.4,,, Pemberton, went out to Queensland, and his ' • s ' .'' ''''''...''''''' '.''''''4s/1 mother died in the</p>
